/> was definitely the one that I've benefitted from the most so far. It talks about some auditing tools that can be used, like 
<Navigable 
  content={"Lighthouse for Chrome"}
  href={"https://developer.chrome.com/docs/lighthouse/overview/"}
  external={true}
  row={7}
